# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Group 8 — release ignore list
#
# Anything listed here is either personal data, institutional data, or a
# re-derivable artefact. Nothing below may be committed, including to a
# private repository: a file committed once stays in the history.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Institutional student records (3,325 students) ------------------------

model_ready_dataset*
data_local/

# --- Educator study: responses, coding, reconciliation ---------------------

*_consensus.csv
THEMATIC_ANALYSIS*.md

# --- Individual-level outputs from the source institution -------------------
# These hold one row per student with the outcome and fee payment status.
# De-identified, but still individual-level institutional data. Keep local
# unless your ethics approval covers deposit. The acceptance gate reads them
# from disk and will report SKIP in CI, which is the intended behaviour.
seed42_predictions.csv
source_subgroup_table.csv
source_operating_point_per_seed.csv

# --- Model artefacts and caches (re-derivable from the scripts) ------------
*.pkl
*_model_bundle*

# --- OULAD raw download ----------------------------------------------------
# Public (CC BY 4.0) but large. The scripts fetch it; see README.
oulad/
studentInfo.csv
studentAssessment.csv
studentVle.csv
assessments.csv

# --- Figures: commit the final exports only, not working versions ----------
*_draft.png
*_wip.*

# --- Python / Jupyter ------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
.env
.DS_Store

# --- Added at the repository root ------------------------------------------
# This file was previously at Code/.gitignore, where its rules applied only to
# Code/ and below. The paths it protects live at the repository root, so the
# list had no effect on them. Keep this copy at the root.

*.xlsx
*.xls
outputs/seed42_predictions.csv
outputs/complete_records_5_7.csv
outputs/perturbation_5_3.csv
RELEASE/*_model_bundle.joblib

# Working notes and anything carrying the group's identifying details.
# G8_FIX_05 is a patch-instruction document, not code, and it contains the
# ethics committee's name, which appears nowhere in the anonymised manuscript.
# Matched without a directory prefix so it stays ignored wherever it is moved.
copy_of_oulad_exp*
G8_FIX_05_patches_and_templates.md

# Superseded by Code/G8_FIX_02_verify_oulad.py. The old script recomputes the
# OULAD outputs at the pre-M1 test-set thresholds (0.4416 / 0.4533) and would
# overwrite the correct artefacts if anyone ran it. Delete it from the working
# tree; ignored here so it cannot be staged by accident in the meantime.
G8_FIX_02_oulad_outputs.py

# Contains four student index numbers (F4). Never commit.
Group8_Project Cinque.docx
